    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1469/38 of November 03, 2006 (as lastamended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1991/44 of November 03, 2016), which specifies the Facultiesand the Departments of the University of Moratuwa, Sri Lanka, which is deemed by virtue of the provisions of Section 139of the aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by the addition immediately afteritem \u201cFaculty of Information Technology\u201d appearing in Column I which corresponds to the entries in Column II of theSchedule of the following item and entries.",
